<div class="sign-demo-shell">
  <details class="sign-demo"{% unless include.collapsible %} open{% endunless %}>
    <summary>Try the interactive demo <span>Hosted on Hugging Face</span></summary>
    <div class="sign-demo-content">
      <p>Choose an <strong>Expected sign</strong> and a <strong>Validation clip</strong>, then select <strong>Run both models on this clip</strong>. Compare the predictions with the source video and timeline.</p>
      <iframe
        src="https://spsarolkar-signlanguagetranslate.hf.space/?embed=true"
        title="SignLanguageTranslate: Indian Sign Language Transformer demo"
        class="sign-demo-frame"
        width="100%"
        height="1000"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allow="fullscreen"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </details>
  <div class="sign-demo-footer">
    <a class="button button-primary" href="https://huggingface.co/spaces/spsarolkar/SignLanguageTranslate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open demo on Hugging Face</a>
    <p>The Space may take a little time to start after being idle. If the embedded view does not load, use the direct link.</p>
  </div>
</div>
